[{"title":"再送董崇相户部课绩","author":"陈第","text":"岁昔在乙巳，送君入上京。\n乱流济扁棹，两岸多莺声。\n一别讵能几，今又送君行。\n浓谈殊未尽，衷曲还愤盈。\n燕蓟正雨雪，胡为独北征。\n行途登泰岱，吴门望正晴。\n上有无字碑，秦汉铭已倾。\n秣陵旧都地，守重隔江城。\n国初宿屯戍，五卫列藩营。\n自从崩圯后，洲渚坦以平。\n何当存犄角，识者为心惊。\n袖中有短疏，意在扣宸明。\n远臣既建白，公辅会相成。\n愿君且静默，造物忌取名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3721,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四忆诗四首 其一","author":"陈第","text":"忆昔在清漳，帐下多童冠。\n切磨论至德，余义及篇翰。\n别来四十年，凋谢已太半。\n登高望海水，茫茫无边岸。\n欲赠以琼瑶，踟蹰岁复晏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3722,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四忆诗四首 其二","author":"陈第","text":"忆昔在蓟门，坐中多剑客。\n萧萧边马鸣，风高秋草白。\n别来三十年，采薇异夙昔。\n登高望紫塞，朔雪沈幽碛。\n欲赠以宝刀，徘徊空脉脉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3723,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四忆诗四首 其三","author":"陈第","text":"忆昔在粤东，樽前多渔父。\n泛海寻仙山，蓬莱若可睹。\n别来已十年，伊人且尘土。\n登高望岭表，浮岚带阴雨。\n欲赠以明珠，惆怅肝肠腐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四忆诗四首 其四","author":"陈第","text":"忆昔在武当，山中多道侣。\n冒雪陟危峰，携筇凌险阻。\n别来已五年，飘飘一羁旅。\n登高望汉水，潇湘迷楚墅。\n欲赠以金丹，叹息独延伫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮客居呈弱侯三篇 其一","author":"陈第","text":"仲尼本周流，忽发归与叹。\n意在就六经，匪为思乡串。\n嗟我老无闻，托兴游汗漫。\n邈想古通人，反侧常宵半。\n秣陵一君子，少小登道岸。\n嗜学自性成，羲易旦夕玩。\n近得从之谈，恍上中天观。\n诗书数千载，立语穷真赝。\n欣然遂忘家，何知有岁晏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮客居呈弱侯三篇 其二","author":"陈第","text":"晨起临北窗，连阴未朗彻。\n昔出桃李华，今看霜霰结。\n爆竹频有闻，天涯近除节。\n而我客南都，心迹俱寂灭。\n外户常反扃，四壁幽以冽。\n执爨虽一夫，饔飧良靡缺。\n晏坐展图书，袪寒亲曲蘖。\n时与达人谈，千古共参折。\n清灯耿前除，谈罢自怡说。\n回首风尘人，迟暮正愁绝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮客居呈弱侯三篇 其三","author":"陈第","text":"玄枵日雨雪，羲御如潜匿。\n庭树凄以摧，朔风吹不息。\n晨起拥孤衾，咄嗟已昏黑。\n蓬径绝来踪，咏歌写胸臆。\n缅想丈人徒，辛勤甘自力。\n贫老荣启期，拾穗意亦得。\n嗟余独何人，无事坐安食。\n时与同心朋，一杯论稼穑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫戒诗寄儿祖念并诸亲友","author":"陈第","text":"梁鸿终会稽，尧夫老雒阳。\n生卒异厥处，达人何慨慷。\n我本游汗漫，野鹤共翱翔。\n今年六十九，鬓发同秋霜。\n久?厌世日，随地为坎藏。\n烟云开翣旐，星月悬灯光。\n形骸虽垒块，神气任徜徉。\n慎勿泥世俗，启土携归乡。\n生既耽五岳，死岂恋一方。\n携归失我意，泉下徒悲伤。\n此心常耿耿，鉴之有穹苍。\n作诗比遗令，小子永勿忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后出塞（以下塞上作）","author":"陈第","text":"万里秋风海上生，驱车今复戍檀城。\n天寒夜渡韦沟水，马尾凝冰碎有声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜峰关","author":"陈第","text":"边日凄凄野色愁，山前流水雪花浮。\n儿童解唱胡人曲，短笛清笳别样秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见杨花","author":"陈第","text":"燕山三月飞杨花，满天白雪随风斜。\n客子出门已十载，飘零感此思回家。\n杨花飞自好，客愁不可道。\n岁岁杨花飞，飞尽春光老。\n春光迅速若转蓬，丈夫建树难为功。\n李广不侯马援谤，至今慨叹伤英雄。\n伤英雄，徒拂抑。\n鬓华忽似杨花色，不如匣剑归去来，南山之南北山北。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送戚都护归田四首 其一","author":"陈第","text":"承平日久不知兵，南北征师浪结营。\n独有鸳鸯明节制，堂堂中国振先声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送戚都护归田四首 其二","author":"陈第","text":"辕门遗爱满幽燕，不见胡尘十六年。\n谁把旌麾移岭表，黄童白叟哭天边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送戚都护归田四首 其三","author":"陈第","text":"朔方辽海怀恩信，日本安南识姓名。\n盖世勋庸仍不伐，循循裘带一书生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送戚都护归田四首 其四","author":"陈第","text":"黄金散尽结英雄，不负行间尺寸功。\n却愧十年鞍马下，捐躯空慕古人风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闵黎吟三首（有引） 其一","author":"万表","text":"地何产楠与速，吾何畜豕与犊。\n豕犊盈盘吏反嗔，楠速穷年束不足。\n但愿黄金满粤南，宁使黎田不盈粟。\n粤南金多吏不索，黎田粟少人未哭。\n刻箭为约安得销，岁岁生当剥吾肉。\n负戈因拚一命偿，嗟嗟黎人谁尔牧？\n皇章惠尔非尔毒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闵黎吟三首（有引） 其二","author":"万表","text":"虎兕来，犹可奔，狼师一来人无存。\n大征纵杀玉石焚，昔人雕剿只一村。\n雕剿功成赏不厚，大征荫子还荫孙。\n杀一不辜尚勿为，何况万骨多冤魂。\n愿君爵赏毋苟贪，但以三槐植尔门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闵黎吟三首（有引） 其三","author":"万表","text":"凿而饮，耕而食，抚黎何事来相逼？\n瘠牛可耕岂不惜，姜水那堪吞满臆。\n遥明灯火忽惊疑，一望旌旗我心恻。\n群黎草木岂有知，贪吏朘削无休息。\n攻掠犯顺谁所为，抚黎毒黎还毒国。\n南征稍喜平崖公，歼扫惟悲不为德。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中酬唐太史见访","author":"万表","text":"山斋寂寞腊初深，披衲朝朝闻梵音。\n我已出家惟带发，君来连榻与同心。\n天涯避地因多病，幻迹随缘即故林。\n明月满庭残雪在，那堪孤棹返山阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日赐百官春饼","author":"申时行","text":"紫宸朝罢听传餐，玉饵琼肴出大官。\n斋日未成三爵礼，早春先试五辛盘。\n回风入仗旌旗暖，融雪当筵七箸寒。\n调鼎十年空伴食，君恩一饭报犹难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应制题扇 杏梨白燕","author":"申时行","text":"群芳烂熳吐春辉，双燕差池雪羽飞。\n玳瑁梁间寒色莹，水晶帘外曙光微。\n轻翻玉剪穿花过，试舞霓裳带月归。\n一自衔恩金屋里，年年送喜傍慈闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烛泪","author":"申时行","text":"风袭帘帷炬色寒，鲛珠错落泻银盘。\n红绡半湿金莲吐，紫焰微销玉箸残。\n传蜡汉宫春厌浥，绝缨楚馆夜阑干。\n须知归院承恩日，涓滴还将雨露看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其一","author":"申时行","text":"铜台金谷总堪伤，昔日繁华已就荒。\n香入燕泥添旧垒，影归鸾镜作残妆。\n帘栊飞絮随春老，庭院游丝共日长。\n闻说仙葩能不谢，谁从海外觅奇方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其二","author":"申时行","text":"名园佳卉剧堪怜，玉褪香消倍黯然。\n旖旎不禁含雨堕，轻扬无奈逐风颠。\n汉宫憔悴悲颜色，韦曲萧条感岁年。\n春去春来如有限，试将圆缺问婵娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其三","author":"申时行","text":"扑面窥帘故恼人，秾华能得几回新。\n漂摇逐浪浑无赖，澹荡随风似有因。\n青鸟衔来沾绮席，紫骝嘶去踏红尘。\n呼童扫径还教住，醉客何妨吐锦茵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其四","author":"申时行","text":"繁华过眼若为情，独倚雕栏数落英。\n朱户月来虚弄影，玉阶星陨不闻声。\n惊鸿雒浦游魂远，飞燕朝阳舞态轻。\n几日啼将春色换，教人错恨树头莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其五","author":"申时行","text":"剩紫残红惨不禁，狂蜂醉蝶杳难寻。\n闲阶半蚀苔痕浅，曲径全埋草色深。\n游子骤惊风雨梦，美人长抱岁时心。\n枝头取次成青子，且共携尊坐绿阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其六","author":"申时行","text":"香阁缤纷可自由，艳姿狼藉倩谁收。\n铅华有恨空辞辇，罗绮无情宛堕楼。\n流出御沟春脉脉，迷来仙洞水悠悠。\n风光递转寻常事，可奈年年送白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其七","author":"申时行","text":"残英片片入埃尘，芳径迢迢遍草莱。\n野鹿衔将溪畔过，杜鹃啼向月中来。\n偶经别院飘歌扇，忽舞前檐送酒杯。\n不似无情东逝水，明年还逐艳阳开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花八首 其八","author":"申时行","text":"春风吹老夕阳斜，一笑嫣然度岁华。\n暂与名园敷锦绣，终怜幻质委泥沙。\n白头吟罢空相忆，红颊啼残转自嗟。\n疑是瞿昙新说法，故教天女散空花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题衲衣","author":"陆树声","text":"解组归来万事捐，尽将身世付安禅。\n披来戒衲浑无事，不尚歌姬为乞缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画像","author":"陆树声","text":"岂有文章置集贤，也无勋业到凌烟。\n只应画作老居士，留与香山结净缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过文山祠","author":"杨巍","text":"丞相名偏重，遗祠世共尊。\n乾坤柴市远，日月蕙楼存。\n一死消胡运，孤忠报汉恩。\n中原还正统，辛苦向谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读谢叠山传","author":"杨巍","text":"宋鼎沉炎海，叠山起信州。\n潜龙终见奋，惊鹤自难收。\n故作君平卜，真怀豫让忧。\n遗忠今尚在，常共大江流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北楼口留别许参戎","author":"杨巍","text":"扰扰烟尘际，离觞对晚晖。\n悲风嘶去马，落叶上征衣。\n野烧临河断，寒沙带雪飞。\n愿君思灭寇，慷慨振军威。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋雨宿黑石岭","author":"杨巍","text":"岭险藤迷路，山高石作城。\n片云何处雨，孤客此时情。\n茅屋几家住，秋风半夜生。\n旅魂愁已绝，况听鼓鼙声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋登龙门城楼二首 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"指点云州地，真为汉北门。\n八城临大漠，一路向中原。\n晴日山川映，秋田黍稷繁。\n文庄经略处，父老至今言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海乡闻雁","author":"杨巍","text":"平芜霜露合，孤雁尚南征。\n影落黄龙渚，声凄魏豹城。\n残云疑路断，新月似弦惊。\n十载关山北，曾伤故国情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答任柏溪韵","author":"杨巍","text":"身世无端梦亦惊，疏慵到处是愁城。\n几年不见渔樵业，垂老仍闻鼓角声。\n旅食新从多病减，炎天谁能远方行。\n劳君佳句频相慰，廊庙江湖别有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过冷泉关次韵","author":"杨巍","text":"西风落木不胜秋，百雉关门控上游。\n标柱何人仍破虏，弃繻狂客慢生愁。\n云开霍岳当天出，雨涨汾河拍岸流。\n到处登临兴感慨，角声高起夕阳楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驱车上东门行","author":"于慎行","text":"驱车上东门，回望咸阳路。\n郁郁五陵间，累累多墟墓。\n长夜号鼪鼬，秋风走狐兔。\n牧竖游且歌，行人四面顾。\n借问此何谁，昔时董与傅。\n车马如流水，第宅通云雾。\n富贵一旦空，忽如草间露。\n阅水日成川，阅世人非故。\n贤愚共一丘，千载为旦暮。\n嗤彼道傍子，营营胡不寤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌十二首 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"秋月照四壁，络纬当窗织。\n徒闻机杼声，终夜不成匹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌十二首 其四","author":"于慎行","text":"始欲识欢时，愿作同心结。\n丝线不相逢，里许暗自别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌十二首 其九","author":"于慎行","text":"枕上看月来，梦中与欢诀。\n月自不相离，欢心不如月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌十二首 其十一","author":"于慎行","text":"侬如水中石，波至亦累累。\n欢如陌上尘，左右从风吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜春歌 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"朱景带碧楼，新风吹罗幌。\n谁能怀春情，不发柔弦响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜春歌 其三","author":"于慎行","text":"金屋燕初飞，长堤草已绿。\n春蚕不作茧，思子何由续。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜夏歌 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"何处复无暑，月出湖水边。\n汎舟芙蓉里，分明自取莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜夏歌 其三","author":"于慎行","text":"含桃初作花，畏恐旁人见。\n今日食含桃，空条谁复盼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜秋歌 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"凉风夜中来，白露凝如玉。\n不敢拭清砧，捣衣乱心曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜秋歌 其三","author":"于慎行","text":"露井冻银床，秋风生桐树。\n任吹桐花飞，莫吹梧子去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜冬歌 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"万里覆寒云，千林飞素雪。\n此时为欢愁，心如三伏热。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜冬歌 其三","author":"于慎行","text":"华茵倚重炉，璇房捲罗幕。\n惊见雪花飞，谓是杨花落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续曲歌 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"侬作博山炉，双烟吐不住。\n郎如飘风吹，但将香引去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀二十首 其八","author":"于慎行","text":"东出长安门，倚马息道周。\n上有百年木，下有万古流。\n华轩驰广陌，冠盖如云浮。\n去者日以远，来者日以遒。\n朱颜入朝市，皓首将安求。\n应侯朝上书，蔡泽暮西游。\n荣枯在俯仰，譬海浮水沤。\n所以赤松徒，屣脱万户侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗八首 其四","author":"于慎行","text":"北登辽阳城，顾望三韩道。\n大海何萧条，白骨横野草。\n下充蛟鱼食，上使乌鸢饱。\n伤哉十万师，大半涂肝脑。\n粟米量如沙，金帛积成岛。\n功名诚可为，封疆在自保。\n闭关谢远人，良图胡不考。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗八首 其六","author":"于慎行","text":"延陵有长剑，宝若千金璧。\n闭匣泣风雨，开匣干星日。\n骏马与名都，罗列终不易。\n服之适异土，见谓铅刀质。\n徐君亦何为，神襟独尔识。\n欲色在不言，心许成莫逆。\n如何历聘归，墓门已有棘。\n含意竟未伸，涕下空沾臆。\n宰木集晨风，可以悬三尺。\n寸心苟不渝，是物何足惜。\n驱马去郊原，弃置如遗迹。\n贤哉贵公子，交情固金石。\n咄彼市门徒，景行宜自惕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗八首 其八","author":"于慎行","text":"神龙时未遇，蠖略蟠深渊。\n不有浮云藉，何由润八埏。\n鹍鹏随海运，一徙阴重玄。\n扶摇非有负，羽翮安能旋。\n远臣必有主，迩臣必有先。\n商君因景监，五羖介穆贤。\n内资富强业，外秉侯王权。\n功名岂不伟，烈士无称焉。\n行藏制在己，升沉制在天。\n寸尺既可枉，寻丈宁无愆。\n所以鲁连子，抗志青冥间。\n只矢三军解，单辞六国全。\n万钟苟不欲，屣脱如浮烟。\n谅哉天下士，畴克与比肩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道","author":"于慎行","text":"东出灞陵桥，回望长安道。\n烟花万户暖风轻，罗绮千门明月晓。\n汉家宫阙郁岧峣，碧阁珠楼倚绛霄。\n丞相衣冠苍玉佩，将军甲第赤栏桥。\n平明内殿承颜色，日晏朝回行紫陌。\n夹道金羁赭汗流，盈门绣辖朱尘塞。\n人生得意自辉光，刺谒纷纭满路旁。\n一笑看人回禄命，片言酬客腐肝肠。\n小子胜衣皆受印，苍头结绶亦为郎。\n貔虎三千陈列第，鸳鸯七十闭东厢。\n银床月瑩流苏帐，翠幕烟浮玳瑁梁。\n镫前北里千金舞，座上宜城九酝觞。\n年去年来无旦暮，春花秋月依然度。\n歌吹平连长乐钟，林园直接新丰树。\n祗知娱乐不知忧，转眼荣华逐水流。\n谁道冰山可永峙，谁言天雨可重收。\n曾闻上将幽钟室，曾见元公赐养牛。\n博陆门前罗鸟雀，平津邸内走鼪鼬。\n古来世事浑如许，道上垂杨不解语。\n唯有东陵旧日侯，瓜田看尽青门雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大堤曲","author":"于慎行","text":"大堤春尽花成雨，大堤女儿隔花语。\n扬州估客四角幡，暮泊兰桡宿江渚。\n芙蓉宝帓绿云鬟，翠簟银缸夜色寒。\n倚瑟当垆春酒尽，卷帷望月晓装残。\n石城一曲歌未足，日出天空江水绿。\n含啼送客更多愁，肠断烟波万里秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上云乐","author":"于慎行","text":"东厢食举百戏作，鱼龙曼衍中堂落。\n华钟忽驻舞缀停，更进西方《上云乐》。\n老胡家世是文康，紫髯深目华盖方。\n白巾裹头火浣细，绿珠作带韎?长。\n曾从海上栽若木，吹笙更截昆崙竹。\n朝看阿母鬓成霜，夕见安期颜似玉。\n却候明时日再中，朅来献赆玉门东。\n流沙暮涉三万里，碣石天开百二重。\n辟邪师子陈成列，赴曲声随箫鼓节。\n汉苑白麟未足珍，宛城宝马空称绝。\n老胡歌舞奏仙倡，为祝黄图日月长。\n但愿百蛮九塞靖烽火，陛下长倾万岁觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":3782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]